<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">TIMOTHY-DA I-ba Paul-gi Ahanba Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTHY-DA</para>
  <para style="mt2">I-ba Paul-gi Ahanba Chithi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">1 Timothy hairiba lairik asi Pakhonchatpa Paul-na mahakki tung-inba Timothy-da i-ba chithini. 1 Timothy asi chaorakna Christtana poklaba matung chahi 62-64 aduwaida iramba yai. Masi Paul-gi punsi loiramdai aduwaida oigani. Paul-ga Timothy-ga naknaba mari leirammi, mahakna Timothy-bu ichanupa haina kayarak palli (Philippians 2:22; 1 Timothy 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chithi asi Paul-na singlupta nattaduna misak amada i-ba chithi marigi manungda amani. Atoppa chithi ahumdudi 2 Timothy, Titus amasung Philemon-ni. 1 Timothy asi singlupta Tengban Mapu khurumbagi (2:1-15), singlupki ahal ama oibagi magunsing (3:1-13) amasung aranba tambibasinggi maramda piba cheksin wasing (1:3-11, 4:1-5, 6:2-5) hairibasing asigi maramda piba paotak kaya yaori. Timothy-bu singlupsinggi manungda luchingba ama oinaba Paul-na tambiba adu utli. Eikhoigi matam asigi lam lamda leiba singlupsingda karamna yengsin-gadage haibagi singlupki luchingbasingda kanagadaba achumba kaya ama yaori.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paul-na Timothy-bu khurumjaduna houba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Mahakna Timothy-da aranba tambibasinggi maramda cheksin wa haiba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 1:3-11">1:3-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Jisu Christtagi maramda Paul-na kaya haraojaba haibadu makha tana sandokna takpa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 1:12-19">1:12-19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Mathangda mahakna singlupta Tengban Mapu khurumbagi amadi singlupki luchingba ama oibagi maramda Timothy-da paotak piba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 2-3">2–3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Timothy-da aroiba paotak piraga Paul-na mahakki chithi asi loisilli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 4-6">4–6</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Eikhoigi Kanbiba Mapu Tengban Mapu Ibungo amasung eikhoigi asa oiriba Christta Jisugi yangthang matung inna Christta Jisugi pakhonchatpa oiriba Paul eihakna--<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Pakhon 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Thajabagi marida tasengba ichanupa oiriba Timothy-da chithi asi i-jari:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapu amasung eikhoigi Mapu Ibungo Christta Jisuna thoujal, chanbiba amasung ingthaba nangonda pibiba oirasanu.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aranba tambibasinggi maiyokta piba cheksin wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Eina Macedonia chatlamdaida eina nangonda kanna haikhibagumna, nahakna Ephesus-ta makha tana leithaba adu eihakna pammi maramdi mapham aduda mi kharana aranba tambiba kaya ama tambiri makhoising adu nahakna lepnanaba yathang pigadabani. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Marei yetnaba khakta thok-hanba thainagi semjin sajinba warising amadi pari purigi sangkhraba mathang mathang chattharakliba parengsing aduda pukning luptanaba makhoida haiyu; madusing aduna thajabagi mapanna khangba Tengban Mapu mahakki thourang aduda kari amata mateng oide. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Yathang asigi pandamdi asengba thammoi, aphaba achum aran khangba pukning amasung tousinnaba yaodaba thajabadagi thorakpa nungsiba aduni. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Mi kharadi masising asidagi leithokkhraga, karisu kanadaba waremda onsin-khre. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Makhoina Tengban Mapugi wayel yathang tambiba oja amadi oining-i, adubu makhoi masana ngangliba wa adu karino haiba makhoina khangjade aduga makhoina yamna thajana ngangliba hiramsing adugi maramda khangjade.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Wayel Yathang haibasi magi sijinnapham adu chumna sijinnarabadi madu aphabani haiba eikhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Wayel yathang asi achumba chatpa misinggidamakta semba natte adubu wayel yathang indaba, irang houba mi, Tengban Mapu ningdaba, pap chenba, sengdaba amadi lainingchettaba, makhoigi mama mapabu hatpasing, mihatpasing <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>nupa nupigi oiba marida lamchat naidaba, nupa masel nupi masel haktinnaba, mi phaduna mibu minai oina lallonbasing, minamba ngangba amadi lanna sakhi pibasing, amasung tambiriba achumbasing adugi onna-teinaba touba makhoi pumnamaksing adugidamak sembani haiba eikhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Tambiriba achumbasing adu eibu sandoknaba sinnabiriba aphaba pao aduda yao-i, Aphaba Pao adudi yaipharaba matik mangalgi Tengban Mapudagi lakpani.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi thoujal-gidamak thagatchaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Eibu panggal pibiriba eikhoigi Mapu Ibungo Christta Jisubu eina thagatchei, madudi Ibungo mahakki thougalgidamak mahakna eibu khandokpiduna eibu thajaba yaba oina singthabire. <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Pakhon 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4">9:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:5">5</ref></char></note>Houkhiba matam amada eihak Ibungobu thina ngangba, ot-neiba amasung Ibungobu ikaiba piba oiramlabasu madu eina toukhiba adu khangdabadagi amadi thajaba leitribagi oiba maramna eibu Tengban Mapuna chanbiba utpire. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Eikhoigi Mapu Ibungogi thoujal adu eingonda marang kaina heithabire aduga Christta Jisuda leiba thajaba amasung nungsiba aduga loinana eingonda pibire. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Christta Jisuna pap chenbasingbu kanbinaba taibangpan asida lengbirakpani haiba wapham asi thajaba yaba amadi mapung phana lousinbada matik chabani. Pap chenbasinggi marakta eihakna khwaidagi henna pap chenbani. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Adum oinamak maram asigidamak haibadi pap chenbasinggi marakta khwaidagi pap chenba eingonda Tengban Mapuna chanbiba adu utpire, madu Ibungo mahakpu tungda thajagababa amadi lomba naidaba punsi phanggadaba mi pumnamakta Christta Jisuna mahakki kuina khaangheiba adu pandam oina utpinanabani. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Lomba naidaba Ningthou, siba naidraba, uba ngamdaba, amatta ngairaba Tengban Mapu Ibungo mangonda matam pumnamakta ikai khumnaba amasung matik mangal leiba oirasanu! Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Eigi ichanupa Timothy, nahakki maramda Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokkhiba adugi matung inna yathang asi eina nangonda piri, madusing adu ningsingduna ningthijana lan soknou, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>thajaba amasung amakpa leitaba achum aran khangba pukning adu chetna paiyu. Mi kharanadi makhoigi achum aran khangba pukning adu thawoidabadagi, makhoigi thajaba adu pummang manghalle. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Makhoidugi marakta Hymenaeus amasung Alexander-su yao-i, makhoina Tengban Mapubu thina ngangba adu toknaba eina makhoibu Satan-gi makhutta sinnare.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Singlupta Tengban Mapu khurumbagi maramda takpi tambiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1-2"/>Eikhoina Tengban Mapuda laining chetna amadi asengba punsi mahing amaga loinana ingna chikna panba punsi ama hingba yananaba mi pumnamakki, ningthousinggi amasung angam athou pumnamakkidamak wakatpiba, nibiba, haijabiba amasung thagatnaba eina ahanbamaktada nahakpu thougatli. <verse eid="1TI 2:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Eikhoigi Kanbiba Mapu Tengban Mapu Ibungogi maphamda masi aphaba amasung apenbani, <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>mi pumnamakna kanbiba phangba amasung makhoina achumba adubu khangba haibasi Ibungo mahakna pammi. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Maramdi Tengban Mapu ama lei aduga Tengban Mapu amasung mioibabu tainabiba misak ama lei, mahak adudi mioiba ama oiriba Christta Jisuni. <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>Mahakna mioiba pumnamakpu thadokpinaba thadokmal oina mahak masamakpu pibire. Achaba matamda mi pumnamakpu kanbiba Tengban Mapuna pammi haibasi masina pramanni, <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2 Tim 1:11</ref></char></note>maram asigidamak Jihudi nattabasingda pakhonchatpa amadi tambiba ama oina thajaba amadi achumbagi paojel sandoknaba eibu thabire. Eihakna chinthiba natte; achumba adu hairibani!<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Aduna Tengban Mapu khurumbagi thouram khudingda asaoba amasung yetnaba yaodana Tengban Mapugidamak katthoklaba nupasingna khut thanggattuna Tengban Mapuda haijaba adu eina pammi. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1 Pet 3:3</ref></char></note>Nupisingna ing tappa amasung mapham matam khangbaga loinana ningthijana phijet setpa asisu eina pammi; ahenba leitengna sambu make semba nattraga sanana nattraga mani-muktana nattraga mamal yamba phijetna leitengdasanu, <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>adubu Tengban Mapu ningbi nupi ama oibagi matik chaba aphaba thabaksingna leitengsanu. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Nupisingna tuminna leiduna amadi nolukpaga loinana tamjasanu. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Nupina tambiba, nattraga nupagi mathakta panba eina yade, makhoi tuminna leigadabani. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Meihou 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:21">Meihou 2:21</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 2:22">22</ref></char></note>Maramdi Adam-bu hanna sembikhibani aduga mathangda Eve-pu sembibani. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Meihou 3:1-6</ref></char></note>Namthak toukhiba adu Adam-bu natte; nupi adubu namthak touduna Tengban Mapugi wayel yathang thugaikhibani. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Adubu nupisingna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek-tadi “mahak” haibani</char></note> thajabada, nungsibada, asengbada amasung phajaba lamchatta leirabadi, chabokpagi mapanna makhoibu kanbigani.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Singlupki luchingbasinggi maramda haiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Wapham asi achumbani: Kanagumba mi amana singlup amagi luchingba ama oiba pamlabadi, mahakna aphaba thabak amabu pamlabani. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tit 1:6-9</ref></char></note>Singlupki luchingba ama haibasi mingchat thiningai oiba amakpa leitaba mi, mahakki nupida thajaba yaba oiba, ka hendaba, masa khudum chanjaba, ikai khumnabada matik chaba, lamlanbasingbu mayumda taramna okpa amadi tambiba ngamba mi ama oigadabani; <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>mahak yuda luppa amadi tamthiba mi ama oiroidabani, adubu pukning tappa, khatnagandaba amadi sel pamgandaba mi ama oigadabani. <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>Mahakki imung manungbu ningthina yengsinba ama oigadabani aduga mahakki angangsingna mahakpu ikaikhumnabaga loinana mahakna haiba inba haibadu oihan-gadabani. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Maramdi kanagumbana masamakki imung manungbu karamna yengsin-gani haiba khangdrabadi mahakna karamna Tengban Mapugi singluppu ngak-sen-gadage? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Mahak nouna thajarakpa mi ama oiroidabani, nattrabadi mahakna napan touduna chaothoklaklabadi Devil-da takhiba wayel adumak mahaksu taba yai. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Singlupki mi nattabasingna ikaikhumnaba misak ama oigadabani madu oirabadi mahak ikaiba nangduna Devil-gi langda taba haibadu oiraroi.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Singlupki thougal toubasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Adugumduna, singlupki thougal toubasingsu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Deacon</char></note> aphaba lichat chatpa amadi pukchel sengba mi oigadabani; makhoi yuda luppa nattraga selda karamba mi oiroidabani; <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>asengba achum aran khangba pukningga loinana phongdokpiraba thajabagi oiba achumba adubu makhoina chetna paiba oigadabani. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Ahanbada makhoibu chang yenggadabani, maduda makhoina mai paklabadi makhoina singlupki thougal tousanu. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Makhoigi nupisingsu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nattraga Deacon oiba nupi</char></note> adugumna aphaba lamchat chatpa amadi miwa ngangdaba oigadabani; ka hendaba amadi maram khudingda thajaba yabi oigadabani. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Thougal toubasing adu nupi amakhaktagi mapuroiba oiba, machasing amasung imung manungbu ningthijana yengsinba ngamba mi oigadabani. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Ningthina thougal toubasing aduna makhoi masagidamak aphaba mingchat phangjaduna Christta Jisuda leiba makhoigi thajaba adugi maramda thouna phana ngangba ngammi.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yamna maru oiba athuppa wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Eina nahakki nanakta yamna thuna lakkani haiba asa tourabasu, eina nangonda waphamsing asi iri. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Adubu karigumba eihak thengtharaklabadi, Tengban Mapugi imung manung haibadi achumbagi yumbi amadi ngaklou oiriba ahingba Tengban Mapugi singlupta karamba machat chatkadage haibadu chithi asina nangonda khanghan-gani. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Eikhoigi laininggi athuppa asi kayada chaokhrabano haiba asi kana amatana yadaba ngamloi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ibungo mahak asi mioiba amagi saktamda phongdokpire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Thawai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">thawaigi oiba saktamda achumba oina utpire</char></note> aduna achumbani haiba utpire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">swargadutsingnasu ujare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ibungo mahakpu phurupsinggi marakta sandokle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">taibangpan-gi mapham pumnamakta thajare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">amasung swargada loukhatpikhre.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Aranba tambibasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Akonba matamda mioi kharana thajaba asi thadoktuna, minamba thawaising amadi lai phattabasingna tambibasing adu in-gani haina Thawai Asengbana sengna haibire. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Asigumba tambibasing asi achum aran khangba pukning adu mei ikpa yotna chakkhrabagumna aphasasinnaba minamba ngangbasingna sandok-i. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Makhoina luhongba amadi akaknaba chinjak khara chaba thing-i. Adubu chinjaksingdudi achumba adu khanglaba amadi thajabasingna Tengban Mapubu thagatcharaga chananaba Tengban Mapuna sembikhraba chinjaksingni. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Tengban Mapuna sembikhraba pot khudingmak aphaba ngaktani; thagatpaga loinana lousinjarabadi yadada karisu leite, <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>maramdi madu Tengban Mapugi wa amadi haijabagi mapanna senghanbire.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christta Jisugi aphaba thougal touba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Nahakna thajaba nachin nanaosingda hiramsing asi haibirabadi, thajabagi wa amadi nahakna illiba achumba tambiba aduda nahakki thawaigi oiba punsi adu yokkhatchabaga loinana Christtagi aphaba thougal touba mi ama oigani, <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Lirubagi karisu kannadaba aduga laininggi maiyokta leiba semjin sajinba warising adudagi namai leithok-u. Tengban Mapu ningba punsi ama hingnabagidamak nasabu sajel toujou. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Hakchang sajel toubagi kannaba khara makhei lei, adubu thawaigi oiba sajeldi hiram khudingmakta kannei, maramdi maduda houjik hinglingei punsi asigidamak amasung lakkadaba punsi adugidamak wasakpiba lei. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Wapham asi achumbani amasung lousinbada matik chabamakni. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Mi pumnamakkidamak, thoidok hendokna thajabasinggidamak Kanbiba Mapu oiriba ahingba Tengban Mapu aduda eikhoigi asa thamjaduna eikhoina thabak nomduna kanna hotnabani.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Waramsing asi yathang piduna tambiyu. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Kana amatana nahakpu naha oiri haiduna hanthana yenghan-ganu adubu ngangbada, lichat sajatta, nungsibada, thajabada amasung sengna hingba punsida thajabasinggidamak pandam oiyu. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Eina laktriba phaoba nakhoigi tinnabada Tengban Mapugi wahei paba, pao sandokpa amasung tambibada pukning chang-u. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Ahallupna nanggi nathakta khut thambiba matamda Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpasingna haibikhiba adugi mapanna nangonda pibikhiba thawaigi oiba khudol adu miraiba touganu. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Hairibasing asi thabak oina touduna nasamak katthokchou madu oirabadi mi khudingna nahak chaokhatlakli haibadu ugani. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Nahak nasamakki maramda amadi tambiba adugi maramda cheksillu. Madu touduna leiyu maramdi nahakna madu tourabadi nahak nasamak amadi nahakki wa tabasing adubu kanbigani.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Thajabasinggi maphamda tougadaba thoudangsing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Ahal oirabasingbu thina cheiganu, adubu nahakki ipagumna khanduna pukning thougatpiyu; naha oibasingbu nanaogumna, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>ahal oirabi nupisingbu nahakki imagumna amasung naha oibi nupisingna nachan-gumna khanduna pukning sengna loinabiyu.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Kana leijadrabi lukhrabisingbu ikaikhumnabiyu. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Kanagumbi lukhrabi amagi macha masu leirabadi, macha masusing aduna makhoina ahanbada makhoi masagi imung manungda makhoigi laininggi oiba thoudang adu pangthokpa tamsanu aduga asumna makhoigi mama mapa amadi mapu mabenda laman singsanu maramdi masi Tengban Mapugi maphamda apenbani. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Yengsinbinaba kana leijadrabi lukhrabi aduna Tengban Mapuda asa thamjaduna, mahakpu pangbinaba ahing nungthil animakta haijei. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Adubu masa nungainaba hinglibi lukhrabi adudi hinglabasu mahak sirabani. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Mingchat thiba leitanaba makhoida hiramsing asi haibiyu. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Adubu kanagumbana mahakki mari mata maru oina mahak masamakki imung manunggi mibu yok-thaktrabadi, thajaba asi yajadre amasung thajadaba midagi mahakna henna phattre.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Chahi humphu sudribi kana amata lukhrabisinggi marakta masing chalhan-ganu. Madugi mathakta mahakki mapuroibagi maphamda thajaba yaba punsi ama hinglambi misak ama oigadabani, <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>amadi aphaba thabakkidamak mayamna sonnarabi haibadi machasingbu ningthina yok-thaklakpi, lamlanbasingbu taram taram tourambi, Mapu Ibungogi misinggi makhongbu hamdokpirambi, awa ana tarabasingbu pangbirabi amasung aphaba thabak khudingmakta maram okpi oirambi ama oigadabani.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Naha oiribi lukhrabisingbu lukhrabigi masingda chalhan-ganu, maramdi makhoigi hakchanggi apambana makhoina Christtagidamak katthokchaba adudagi hen-gatlakpada makhoi mayum panninggani. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Asumna makhoigi hanna thamkhiba wasak adu thugaibagi wayel phangba oigani. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Aduta nattana, yum yumda koichat chattuna matam manghanbagi heinabi leigani. Aduga makhoina karisu toudaba aduta nattana warem ngangba amasung migi thabakta khut thingjinduna, makhoina ngangloidaba wa ngangba oigani. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Maram aduna naha oiribi lukhrabisingna amuk hanna mayum panduna machasing poktuna mayum makei ningthina panba haibasi eina pammi. Madu oirabadi yeknabasingna maral sinnabagi khudongchaba adu phanglaroi. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Lukhrabi kharadi leithoktuna Satan-gi matung inkhre. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Kanagumbi thajabi nupi amagi imungda lukhrabising leirabadi, mahakna makhoibu yengsinbigadabani maduna singlupta potlum oihalloidabani, madu oirabadi kana leijadrabi lukhrabisingbu singlupna pangbiba ngamgani.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Singlupki thabak touduna chingbiriba ahal lamansing, maru oina Tengban Mapugi wahei sandokliba amadi tambiriba makhoising adu saruk ani henna ikai khumnabada matik chai. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Aniwa 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10:7</ref></char></note>Maramdi Mapugi asengba Puyana hai, “Sallababu maheimarong netthat-hallingeida machin pun-ganu” aduga “Thabak suba mina asuman phangba matik chai.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Aniwa 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note>Mi ani nattraga ahumgi sakhi leitrabadi, singlupki ahal amagi mathakta maral siba wa louganu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Mi ateinasu kinaba pap touriba ahansingdu miyam mangda cheiyu.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Tengban Mapu, Christta Jisu amasung khanggatlaba swargadutsinggi mamangda eina nangonda hairi madudi nahakna achan mirai naidana, misak mimai yengdana hiramsing asi ngak-u. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Tengban Mapugi thougan-gidamak misingbu katthoknaba makhoigi mathakta khut thambada hathu hathuganu. Mi ateigi papka saruk yaminnaganu; nahak nasamak sengna thamjou.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Nahakna ising khakta thakkanu, nahakki chakkhaogidamak amasung nahakna toina nabagi maramana yu khara khara sijinnou.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Mi kharagi papti iphong phong-i, wayenbagi maphamda makhoigi mang thana chatli aduga kanagumba kharagi papti makhoigi matung illi. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Adugumduna aphaba thabakti iphon phong-i, aduga iphong phongba nattabasing adusu matam pumbagi oina lottuna thamba ngamde.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Tengban Mapugi ming amadi eikhoigi tambiba asi thina ngangdanaba, minaigi potpu puribasingna, makhoigi mapusingbu ikai khumnabada matik chabani haina khan-gadabani. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Christian-singna mapu oiriba makhoising aduna, makhoi thajaba maselni haiduna thawoi usittaba touroidabani. Madugi mahutta maduna henna phajana thougal tougadabani; maramdi makhoina touriba thougal adudagi kanaba phangliba adu thajabasingni amasung makhoina nungsijabasingni.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Aranba Tambiba amadi Achumba Lan</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Hiramsing asi nahakna tambiyu amasung thoujinbiyu. <verse eid="1TI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Eikhoigi Mapu Ibungo Jisu Christtagi achumba wahei amasung eikhoigi laininggi tambiba adudagi tonganba kanagumbana tambirabadi, <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>makhoidi karisu khangdaba amasung napan toubasingni. Yetnaba amasung waheigi maramda chinda paodanaba pammi maduna kalakpa, yetnaba, yengthinabagi wari, phattana chingnaba thok-halli, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>amasung achumba adu leitraba, pukning phattraba misinggi marakta tattana yanadaba thok-halli. Tengban Mapu ningba asi lan-thum tongjanabagi pambeini haina makhoina khalli.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Adubu penthokpaga loinana Tengban Mapu ningba haibasi yamna tongjabani. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Maramdi eikhoina taibangpanda karisu pudana lakle, aduga masidagi eikhoina karisu puba ngamloi. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Chanaba amasung setnaba leirabadi maduna eikhoi penthokchagani. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Inak khuningba misingdi athembada tai amasung apangba amadi misingbu mangtakpada tahanba phattaba apambasing adugi langda thui. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Sel pamganbadi phattaba pumnamakki hourakphamni; mi kharadi sel pammanbadagi thajabadagi lammuknakhre aduga awaba kayaga loinana makhoigi thamoi kaire.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Timothy-da piba aroiba yathang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Adubu he Tengban Mapugi mi, nahakti pumnamak asidagi chenthok-u. Achumba chatpa, Tengban Mapu ningba, thajaba, nungsiba, khaangheiba, pukning tappa oinanaba hotnou. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Thajabagi akanba laan adu soknou. Lomba naidaba hingba adu chetna paiyu masida nahakpu koubire amasung sakhi kayagi mamangda nahakna phongdokle. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Jn 18:37</ref></char></note>Pumnamakpu hingba pibiriba Tengban Mapu amasung Pontius Pilate-ki mangda mahakki thajaba adu chingnaba leitana haidokkhiba Christta Jisugi mamangda eina nangonda yathang piri, <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>madudi Ibungo Jisu Christta phongdoktriba phaoba amakpa amasung mingchat thiba yaodana yathang asi ngak-u. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Yaiphaba amasung Leingakpa, ningthousinggi Ningthou amasung mapusinggi Mapu, Tengban Mapuna madu achaba matamda thok-hanbigani. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Sinaidaba asi Ibungo Mahak khaktani amadi kananasu changsinba ngamdaba mangal aduda Ibungo mahak lei. Aduga kana amatana Ibungo mahakpu ukhidri amasung ubasu ngamde. Ibungo mangonda ikai khumnaba amasung lomba naidana panggal leiba oirasanu! Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Houjikki taibangpanba asida inakkhullibasing makhoina pukning nawangdanaba amadi areppa leitaba landa asa thamdanaba adubu eikhoibu nungainanaba pot pumnamak marang kaina pibiba Tengban Mapuda makhoigi asa thamjanaba yangthang piyu. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Aphaba thabak tounaba, aphaba thabakta inak khunnaba amasung pina heiba oinanaba amadi makhoigi areiba adu ateisingga saruk yaminnanaba makhoida yathang piyu. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Matou asumna lakkadaba matamgidamak makhoina achetpa yumpham thonbagumna makhoigidamak makhoina lansing peisinjagani, asumna achumba hingba oiriba hingba adubu makhoina paijagani.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Timothy, nangonda sinnaraba adu ngak-u; Tengban Mapubu ikai khumnadaba wa ngangba amadi mioi kharana lanna “Lousingni” haina kounaba yanadaba wakhallonsing adudagi mai leithok-u. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Mioi kharadi madu phangle haijaduna thajaba adudagi leithokkhre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Thoujalna nakhoi pumnamakta loinabisanu.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
